        "id": 1221725
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-12-18T22:31:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm, is there a technical reason why we\u0027re requiring unique callbacks? If so, we will need to check that in the system server.\n\nTechnically a caller could call directly into the binder, bypassing ConnectivityDiagnosticsManager, and something might go majorly wrong.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 174,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 174,
        "endChar": 50
      },
      "revId": "ded1351d766b219753f287afab38daadff571774",
